{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n視帝陳豪（Mo）近日為TVB節目《弊傢伙！有嘢唔見咗！》擔任嘉賓，竟一改平日沉穩形象，激罕展現活潑跳脫一面！節目中他不僅「常識王」上身瘋狂得分，答中後更興奮到手舞足蹈花式慶祝，場面震撼，究竟這位型男爸爸在節目中還爆出甚麼驚人金句？\n</p>\n<h2>陳豪常識王上身 手舞足蹈瘋狂慶祝</h2>\n<p>在11月13日公布的節目片段中，陳豪與姚子羚、陳楨怡、林景程代表台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》組成「沉船隊」，與傅嘉莉、黃庭鋒等人組成的「躺平隊」進行記憶對決。面對「道路標誌」、「TVB 劇集海報」等題目，陳豪表現最為突出，化身「常識王」之餘，更連環神助攻隊友瘋狂「提水」，每當成功答中題目，他便立即手舞足蹈，以各種花式動作慶祝，與平日的穩重形象形成極大反差，盡顯童心未泯的一面。</p>\n<h2>陳豪再爆Mo式爛Gag 自嘲：我係充滿住情懷</h2>\n<p>陳豪最近因主持《美食強人》時大晒「Mo 式爛 Gag」而深入民心，這次在《弊傢伙！有嘢唔見咗！》中再度技癢。在其中一個「香港情懷」環節，他似乎是為了回應自己的年紀，竟幽默地對著鏡頭自嘲，拋出金句：「我係充滿住情懷」，用一句爛Gag輕鬆帶過年齡話題，引發現場爆笑，展現其獨特的幽默感。</p>\n<h2>《玫瑰戰爭》演員大對決 陳豪領軍沉船隊</h2>\n<p>首集《弊傢伙！有嘢唔見咗！》邀來台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》的8位演員，分成兩隊進行激烈對決。由陳豪領軍的「沉船隊」成員包括姚子羚、陳楨怡和林景程，他們揚言要「整沉對方隻船」，氣勢十足。而對手「躺平隊」則有傅嘉莉、黃庭鋒、陳星妤和吳沚默。兩隊人馬需在四個回合的「記憶對決」中一決高下，爭奪終極Jackpot大獎。</p>\n<h2>網民熱議陳豪反差萌：估唔到Mo哥咁玩得</h2>\n<p>陳豪在節目中罕有的活潑表現，立即引起網民熱烈討論，不少觀眾對他的反差形象感到驚喜。網民紛紛留言大讚：「估唔到Mo哥咁玩得！」、「平時睇佢好cool，原來私下咁活潑！」、「Mo式爛gag返嚟喇！好搞笑！」、「慶祝動作好有戲，不愧係視帝！」、「呢集為咗睇陳豪都一定要追！」。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/01_14723255076af6d4af9b0ec.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/01_14723255076af6d4af9b0ec.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/06_8800346896af6d4e729997.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/06_8800346896af6d4e729997.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/08_2056050136af6d4fbb40b8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/08_2056050136af6d4fbb40b8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_1651544406af6d50269100.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_1651544406af6d50269100.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_9747914536af6d508eb42a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_9747914536af6d508eb42a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_1277301936af6d511744c3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_1277301936af6d511744c3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_20324481466af6d51962708.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_20324481466af6d51962708.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_12374436556af6d52358c7e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_12374436556af6d52358c7e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_2172064076af6d52f9896f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_2172064076af6d52f9896f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_8937237276af6d538c1ffa.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_8937237276af6d538c1ffa.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_14065017886af6d53ea0313.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_14065017886af6d53ea0313.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_272854556af6d543d126d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_272854556af6d543d126d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_6955962006af6d54b22102.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_6955962006af6d54b22102.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_221990346af6d5501c09b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_221990346af6d5501c09b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T13:41:50.900733+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1178,"images":14,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T13:21:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T13:35:24.268153+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T13:35:24.268153+00:00","content_hash":"89be28aec5fc01e79d4bc2c1ad9e90b1543312d3477439b36af67604d50d7f29","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error